 "notes": [
  "Zeemanlaboratorium (pand 0363100012170498, built 1922; rijksmonument 518497; nl:Zeemanlaboratorium). Landmark lane ruling 2026-11-15: large-recipe (punched grid front).",
  "walls[0] NE street panels 5 and 1 (crops w06-30 2019-01-14, w04-30 2016-06-07): three white-framed cross windows grouped in the middle of each 9.5 m panel on two tall storeys; a plinth of red and cream stripes with basement grilles; a stone sill and head band at the upper windows under a plain brick parapet.",
  "walls[1] NE entrance panel 4 (w05-30 2018-11-21): six window axes; the centre risalit with the double door in the plinth, a narrow stained-glass window and the ZEEMAN LABORATORIUM plaque above it, a pair of windows over that, raised parapet (3DBAG).",
  "walls[2] NE east-end infill panel 19 (w08-30m6 2016-06-07): a later concrete-frame bay, three axes of dark-framed windows over dark panels, dark gates on the ground.",
  "walls[3] SW canal panel 8 (w07-210 2021-01-22): three grouped windows per storey over a grey stone plinth.",
  "walls[4] SW canal panels 54, 12, 71 (w03-210, w02-210 2021-01-22): two pairs of windows per panel, small basement windows in the stone plinth.",
  "walls[5] SW canal east-end infill panel 17 (w09-210m6 2017-07-06, w09-210m6L 2021-01-22): a full-height steel-framed glass front between brick piers.",
  "walls[6] NW side panel 6 (w01-300 2023-01-02, behind trees): striped plinth, a window column at each end, a pair in the middle of the upper storey, the wall-fountain niche below it (not drawn).",
  "INFERRED: the roof-storey walls and the SE party/courtyard walls (otherWalls window-grid: no photo).",
  "Colour: brick #643a30 hand-sampled between the shaded street crops (w05-30 normalised #69483b) and the overcast canal pose (2021-03-18); the sunlit canal crops (w02/w03-210) are overexposed (#f8b58b). Groups 0, 1, 3, 4, 6 and the unlisted walls carry it as measured so the look draws it as is."
 ],
